a1\n- Not reproducable in Godot 4.3.stable\n- Regressed in Godot 4.4.dev6\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta1 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics (Intel Corporation; 32.0.101.6078) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-13700H (20 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nLeft: Godot 4.3\nRight: Godot 4.4.beta1\nNo changes to the `Theme` were made.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7d57bfe7-0960-4299-b633-acfd5d43853c)\nText is not in the middle. The ~`OptionButton`~ `EditorObjectSelector` (Uses `Label`, not an OptionButton) is also 1px bigger.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/31445289-5620-40c3-ab76-59eba556e47d)\nText is not in the middle. The `Property` is also 3px bigger. (Was not perfectly centered before as well). `Visible` property from the `Window` class in the `Inspector`.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/657ad203-728c-4dcb-a909-a2635b0a49e2)\n`CheckBox` for a `Property`. Got bigger, but text is as centered as it can be.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Click on a Control, name it `QuickOpenPanel` to get same comparison as me\n- Compare some Controls in the `Inspector` between Godot 4.3 and Godot 4.4.beta\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nShould not be needed since it is very easy to reproduce","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url